    "created_at": "2015-09-22T17:50:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-22T17:50:57Z",
    "body": "We should look into making WebSocket run over Fetch until the \"upgrade\" happens. That would ensure we don't keep running into this mess.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
