    "created_at": "2015-09-25T18:04:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-25T18:04:13Z",
    "body": "I filed errata against the Web Sockets RFC for MIX, which I am assured means that it'll totally get taken care of whenever they update the spec: http://www.rfc-editor.org/errata_search.php?rfc=6455&eid=4398. I doubt that's going to happen anytime soon.\n",
